OL,3,GNEWSARail companies sued for #5m over
OL,4,Aoil spill caused by derailment
OL,5,
OL,6,FNetwork Rail is suing two rail
OL,7,Fcompanies for more than #5m after a
OL,8,Ffuel spill caused by a train derailment
OL,9,Fthreatened an "environmental disaster"
OL,10,Fat a designated site for protection.
OL,12,FThe body filed a legal claim earlier
OL,13,Fthis month against DB Cargo UK and
OL,14,FTouax Rail over the derailment near
OL,15,FLlangennech, Carmarthenshire, in August
OL,16,F2020.
OL,18,FThe incident saw 10 wagons of the
OL,19,F25-wagon train derail, causing 446,000
OL,20,Flitres of fuel to spill, and about 300
OL,21,Fpeople had to leave the area due to the
OL,22,Fblaze.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,434,430,260,140,0,100
