OL,3,GNEWSARail companies sued for #5m over
OL,4,Aoil spill caused by derailment
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn High Court documents, Network Rail
OL,7,Fclaimed that the derailment occurred
OL,8,Fbecause the wagon had "not been
OL,9,Fmaintained with reasonable care" and is
OL,10,Fseeking damages for negligence.
